msgstr "启用后，发往您公司的所有回复（例如 replies@yourcompany.com）都会进入此账户。注意：只能有一个默认收件账户。"

#. Description of the 'Prevent Duplicate Applications' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Job Opening'
#: hrms/hr/doctype/job_opening/job_opening.json
msgid "If enabled, candidates who have already applied with the same email address will not be allowed to apply again"
msgstr "启用后，已使用相同电子邮件地址申请过的候选人将无法再次申请"

#: frontend/src/components/Settings/emailConfig.js:31
msgid "If enabled, emails will be pulled from this account."
msgstr "启用后，系统将从此账户收取邮件。"

#. Description of the 'Automatically run rules on unreconciled transactions'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, rule matching algorithm will run every hour"
msgstr "启用后，规则匹配算法将每小时运行一次"

#. Description of the 'Grant Commission' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
msgid "If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and Sales Partner commission calculations"
msgstr "启用后，此物料的销售额将计入销售人员和销售合作伙伴的佣金计算"

#. Description of the 'Set incoming rate as zero for expired Batch' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, system will set incoming rate as zero for stand-alone credit notes with expired batch item."
msgstr "启用后，对于包含已过期批次物料的独立贷项通知单，系统会将入库率设为零。"

#. Description of the 'Deliver secondary Items' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the Secondary Items generated against a Finished Good will also be added in the Stock Entry when delivering that Finished Good."
msgstr "启用后，针对成品生成的次级物料在交付该成品时也会添加到库存交易中。"

#. Description of the 'Allow internal transfers at user-defined rate' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. This will allow the user to specify a different rate for printing or taxation purposes."
msgstr "启用后，内部转移期间物料费率不会调整为计价率，但会计仍会使用计价率。这允许用户为打印或税务目的指定不同费率。"

#. Description of the 'Allow Alternative Finished Goods' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Manufacturing Settings'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the produced item of a Work Order can be converted into one of its alternative items (defined via Item Alternative) using the 'Change Finished Item' action. The conversion creates a Repack entry linked to the Work Order."
msgstr "启用后，工单生产的物料可以使用“更改成品”操作转换为其替代物料（通过物料替代定义）。转换会创建一个与工单关联的重新包装记录。"

#. Description of the 'Validate Material Transfer warehouses' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different."
msgstr "启用后，物料转移库存交易中的源仓库和目标仓库必须不同，否则会报错。如果存在库存维度，则可以允许相同的源仓库和目标仓库，但至少一个库存维度字段必须不同。"

#. Description of the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. But, this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when it is caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative stock in all other cases."
msgstr "启用后，系统将允许该批次出现负库存交易。但这可能导致计价率不正确，因此建议避免使用此选项。系统仅在负库存由回溯日期的交易引起时允许负库存，其他情况下会验证并阻止负库存。"

#. Description of the 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Batch'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/batch/batch.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock Settings. This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option."
msgstr "启用后，系统将允许此批次出现负库存交易，并覆盖库存设置中的“允许批次负库存”设置。这可能导致计价率不正确，因此建议避免使用此选项。"

#. Description of the 'Allow Editing of Items and Quantities in Work Order'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Manufacturing Settings'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow users to edit the raw materials and their quantities in the Work Order. The system will not reset the quantities as per the BOM, if the user has changed them."
msgstr "启用后，系统将允许用户编辑工单中的原材料及其数量。如果用户更改了数量，系统将不会按照 BOM 重置这些数量。"

#. Description of the 'Enable Stock Delivered But Not Billed' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json
msgid "If enabled, the value of goods delivered before invoicing will be recorded in the Stock Delivered But Not Billed account."
msgstr "启用后，开票前交付的货物价值将记录在“已交付未开票库存”账户中。"

#. Description of the 'Key required' (Check) field in DocType 'Web Form'
#: frappe/website/doctype/web_form/web_form.json
msgid "If enabled, the web form can only be used with a <i>Key</i> from a corresponding <b>Web Form Request</b>."
msgstr "启用后，Web 表单只能使用相应 <b>Web 表单请求</b>中的 <i>密钥</i>。"

#. Description of the 'Include in Charts' (Check) field in DocType 'Financial
#. Report Row'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/financial_report_row/financial_report_row.json
msgid "If enabled, this row's values will be displayed on financial charts"
msgstr "启用后，此行的值将显示在财务图表中"

#. Description of the 'Disable Serial No and Batch selector' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, users must enter Serial No. / Batch data manually instead of using the selector dialog."
msgstr "启用后，用户必须手动输入序列号/批次数据，而不能使用选择器对话框。"

#. Description of the 'Use prices from Default Price List as fallback' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If no Item Price is found for an item in the Price List set in the transaction, prices from the Default Price List will be fetched."
msgstr "如果在交易设置的价格表中找不到物料价格，系统将从默认价格表中获取价格。"

