msgid "What the recipient receives by email when this notification fires. Mirrors Title/Description by default; set these to make the email differ from the in-app text."
msgstr "此通知触发时收件人通过电子邮件收到的内容。默认与标题/描述一致；设置这些字段可使电子邮件内容不同于应用内文本。"

#. Description of the 'Title' (Data) field in DocType 'Sidebar'
#: frappe/desk/doctype/sidebar/sidebar.json
msgid "What this sidebar is called, on screen and as its record name (`autoname: field:title`). Defaults to the module's name, and the default is stored -- so a module's own sidebar keeps the name it has always had, and a second sidebar under that module is told apart by being called something else. `unique` on top of that adds one thing the primary key does not: it refuses a second sidebar claiming the title of a row whose name has drifted away from it -- a legacy row, or one written straight to the table."
msgstr "此侧边栏在界面上的名称以及其记录名称（`autoname: field:title`）。默认为模块名称，并且默认值会被存储——因此模块自己的侧边栏会保留其一直使用的名称，而该模块下的第二个侧边栏则通过使用其他名称来区分。在此基础上设置 `unique` 可增加主键没有的约束：如果某行的名称已偏离标题（例如旧行，或直接写入表中的行），它拒绝另一个侧边栏使用该行的标题。"

